<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92517" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῑπ-ίζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπίς</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blow up</i> or
			<i>fan</i> the flame, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμου ἔριν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cypr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάσιν ἀνεγείρει καὶ ῥιπίζει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					360
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Flam.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόγα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.121
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Diod.
			</span></i>):—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τεμάχη ῥιπίζεται</span> the
			fish <i>is fanned to boiling-point</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				842
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>fan</i> a person, in 
				Med.
			, <i>fan oneself</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				16
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπίζεσθαι ὑπὸ τῶν περιστερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					202.5
				</span></i>
			; <i>to be fanned</i> or <i>blown about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀνέμου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
					1324
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				967a21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀνέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.511
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλύδων ἀνεμιζόμενος καὶ ῥιπιζόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ep.Jac.</u>
					1.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥιπιζομένη ἄχνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					70.4
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ταῖς ἐλπίσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					3.47
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hurl</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				10.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				30
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
